,"speakerName":"Timaeus","textMapHash":2496143633,"text":"Its mechanisms are magical and mysterious, completely unlike the principles that shape our understanding of the physical world.","nextNodeIds":[205060105]},{"nodeId":205060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"Timaeus","textMapHash":4281478969,"text":"If we can get the hang of this, we should be able to create some pretty awesome stuff!","nextNodeIds":[205060106]},{"nodeId":205060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3336087297,"text":"This must be your alchemist's work bench?","nextNodeIds":[205060107]},{"nodeId":205060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"Timaeus","textMapHash":3407590113,"text":"That's right. Why not give it a go yourself?","nextNodeIds":[205060108,205060109]},{"nodeId":205060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3939724241,"text":"I don't know, it sounds complicated...","nextNodeIds":[205060110]},{"nodeId":205060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"Timaeus","textMapHash":3416867041,"text":"You'll be fine, the procedure is actually very simple. If you're interested, I can show you the basics?","nextNodeIds":[205060111]},{"nodeId":205060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1909913761,"text":"Craft","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3815497265,"text":"I'm afraid I'll blow something up!","nextNodeIds":[205060110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2050601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFN